### 2. Set a Feature Flag configuration
The SDK uses the `setConfigurationSetting` method. A feature flag in Azure App Configuration is a specific kind of setting with a special key and a value in a defined format.

Here’s a concise TypeScript snippet from their [featureFlag.ts sample](https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-js/blob/main/sdk/appconfiguration/app-configuration/samples/v1/typescript/src/featureFlag.ts):

